# Source for src/data/zork3/walkthrough.json -- run
# `node tools/build-walkthrough.js --game zork3` to regenerate it, and
# `node tools/verify-walkthrough.js --game zork3` to replay it against the
# real game (tools/play.js) and check every step's "done" condition fires.
#
# Same format as tools/walkthroughs/zork1.src, plus the verifier-only options
# of zork2.src (wander, try=) and one more:
#   guard=PHRASE   before typing the step, the verifier looks at the
#                  Scenic Vista's indicator ("examine indicator") and waits
#                  until the reply contains PHRASE -- the table is only safe
#                  to rub at certain readings.
#
# Zork III's "score" is really a potential out of 7, one point for each of:
# the lake, the viewing table, the man on the cliff, the Royal Puzzle, the
# time machine, and meeting and fighting the hooded figure. The route below
# gets all seven and wins. The game is timed in two places: the aqueduct is
# only usable before an earthquake (some time after move 70), and the
# museum only opens after it.
#
# Randomness: the roc, the fish, the figure's sword, the guards in the
# past, and when the earthquake comes. Only some seeds play clean.

## Across the lake (everything you carry sinks, so go with nothing)
ZORK2-STAIR | take lamp | Your old friend, the lamp | item=lamp
ZORK2-STAIR | south | A dark trail | arrive=JUNCTION
JUNCTION | turn on lamp | You'll need light down here | text=lamp is now on
JUNCTION | south | Cramped passages | arrive=CREEPY-CRAWL
CREEPY-CRAWL | south | A foggy way | arrive=FOGGY-ROOM
FOGGY-ROOM | south | A wide path | arrive=LAKE-SHORE
LAKE-SHORE | drop lamp | Everything you carry will sink if you swim: leave it | cmd
LAKE-SHORE | enter lake | Your first dip. It's cold: go down fast | arrive=ON-LAKE
ON-LAKE | down | See what's on the bottom | arrive=IN-LAKE
IN-LAKE | take shiny object | Something glitters in the sand (it may slip away: try again) | text=simple golden amulet | until=simple golden amulet try=up
IN-LAKE | up | Back up for air | arrive=ON-LAKE | wander
ON-LAKE | west | The western shore | arrive=FAR-SHORE
FAR-SHORE | south | A small chamber | arrive=VIEW-ROOM
VIEW-ROOM | take torch | A burning torch on the wall | cmd
VIEW-ROOM | rub table | Wait until the indicator reads II, then rub the table | arrive=ROOM-8 | guard=reads "II"
ROOM-8 | take repellent | Quick, before you are pulled back | cmd
ROOM-8 | wait | You'll be pulled back to the chamber in a moment | text=back in the viewing room
VIEW-ROOM | rub table | Now wait for III, then rub it again | arrive=DAMP-PASSAGE | guard=reads "III"
DAMP-PASSAGE | drop torch | Leave the light burning here for later | cmd
DAMP-PASSAGE | wait | You'll be pulled back to the chamber in a moment | text=back in the viewing room
VIEW-ROOM | north | Out of the chamber | arrive=FAR-SHORE | wander
FAR-SHORE | spray repellent on me | Something to keep the dark at bay -- for just a few moments | text=old socks
FAR-SHORE | enter lake | Hurry! Across the lake, quickly | text=drop all your possessions
ON-LAKE | south | The southern shore | arrive=SOUTH-SHORE
SOUTH-SHORE | south | Into the dark | arrive=GROUP-DARK-PLACE
GROUP-DARK-PLACE | south | Keep moving | text=dim light | wander
GROUP-DARK-PLACE | east | Toward the light | arrive=KEY-ROOM | wander
KEY-ROOM | take key | The key shifts shape in your hand | cmd
KEY-ROOM | move cover | A manhole cover to one side | text=small hole
KEY-ROOM | down | The aqueduct | arrive=AQ-1
AQ-1 | north | Along the channel | arrive=AQ-2
AQ-2 | north | Across the arch | arrive=AQ-3
AQ-3 | north | Down the water slide | arrive=DAMP-PASSAGE
DAMP-PASSAGE | take torch | Your light is waiting | item=torch

## The cliff, the old man and the secret door
DAMP-PASSAGE | west | Back to the junction | arrive=JUNCTION
JUNCTION | west | The wide trail | arrive=CLEARING
CLEARING | west | Toward the trees | arrive=CLIFF
CLIFF | take bread | Somebody left a snack | cmd
CLIFF | down | A rope hangs over the cliff | arrive=CLIFF-LEDGE
CLIFF-LEDGE | wait | You are not alone for long | text=a man appears | until=a man appears
CLIFF-LEDGE | tie rope to chest | The man has a suggestion | text=chest is lifted | until=chest is lifted
CLIFF-LEDGE | wait | He said he'd be back | text=grab onto the rope | until=grab onto the rope
CLIFF-LEDGE | take rope | Hold on tight | text=wooden staff
CLIFF | east | Back to the barren area | arrive=CLEARING
CLEARING | east | And the junction | arrive=JUNCTION
JUNCTION | east | The damp passage | arrive=DAMP-PASSAGE
DAMP-PASSAGE | northeast | Keep trying until someone is home | text=wizened man | wander
MSTAIRS | wake man | A sleeping old man | text=roused to consciousness
MSTAIRS | give bread to man | He looks hungry | text=secret door
MSTAIRS | open door | There is a way through | text=massive stone door opens

