## The time machine
GROUP-ROYAL-PUZZLE-ENTRANCE | north | Back up the steps | arrive=GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE
GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE | north | The Museum of Technology | arrive=GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | turn dial to 776 | A golden machine with a dial: the museum's year of construction | text=dial is set to 776
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | push button | Even out of the machine, the button counts | text=Nothing seems to have happened
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | drop all | Nothing you hold survives the trip | text=ancient book: Dropped || cmd
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | push gold machine south | It can be pushed -- gently | arrive=GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE
GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE | open stone door | The door to the crown jewels | text=door is now open
GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE | push gold machine east | Into the jewel room | arrive=GROUP-JEWEL-ROOM
GROUP-JEWEL-ROOM | board gold machine | Get in quickly | text=now in the gold machine
GROUP-JEWEL-ROOM | push button | Travel to the year you set | text=surroundings appear to have changed
GROUP-JEWEL-ROOM | take ring | Where there was a cage, now just a pedestal | text=wearing the golden ring
GROUP-JEWEL-ROOM | wait | Voices outside: wait for the guards to leave | text=guards marching away | until=guards marching away
GROUP-JEWEL-ROOM | open door | The way out is locked from the other side only | text=door is now open
GROUP-JEWEL-ROOM | west | Into the unfinished entrance | arrive=GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE
GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE | open wooden door | To the machine | text=wooden door opens
GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE | north | The unfinished technology room | arrive=GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | board gold machine | Get in | text=now in the gold machine
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | put ring under seat | Nothing you hold survives the trip back -- except what you hide | text=concealed underneath the seat
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | turn dial to 948 | Back to the present | text=dial is set to 948
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | push button | Home | text=somewhat altered
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | look under seat | Something is waiting | text=find the ring under the seat
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | get out | Out of the machine | text=own feet
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | take all | Your things are still here | cmd
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | open door | The door has closed again | text=wooden door opens
GROUP-TECHNOLOGY-MUSEUM | south | Back to the entrance | arrive=GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE

## The hooded figure
GROUP-MUSEUM-ENTRANCE | west | Through the cleft | arrive=MUSEUM-ANTE
MUSEUM-ANTE | north | The royal hall | arrive=WIDE-HALL
WIDE-HALL | north | The crystal grotto | arrive=ROCKY-ROOM
ROCKY-ROOM | west | The tight squeeze | arrive=TIGHT-SQUEEZE
TIGHT-SQUEEZE | west | The creepy crawl | arrive=CREEPY-CRAWL
CREEPY-CRAWL | southwest | Into the land of shadow | arrive=GROUP-LAND-OF-SHADOW
GROUP-LAND-OF-SHADOW | wait | Somebody is watching you | text=hooded figure appears | until=hooded figure appears
GROUP-LAND-OF-SHADOW | attack figure with sword | A fair fight -- until it's nearly beaten | text=badly hurt and defenseless | fight=badly hurt and defenseless
GROUP-LAND-OF-SHADOW | take hood | Now it can't stop you | text=cloak remains on the ground
GROUP-LAND-OF-SHADOW | take cloak | The cloak is yours | cmd
GROUP-LAND-OF-SHADOW | east | Back to the creepy crawl | arrive=CREEPY-CRAWL
CREEPY-CRAWL | north | The junction | arrive=JUNCTION
JUNCTION | east | The damp passage | arrive=DAMP-PASSAGE
DAMP-PASSAGE | northeast | The engravings room | arrive=MSTAIRS
MSTAIRS | north | Through the secret door | arrive=MR-ANTE
MR-ANTE | north | The beam room | arrive=MREYE
MREYE | drop torch | Something to break the red beam | text=block the beam
MREYE | south | To the button | arrive=MR-ANTE
MR-ANTE | push red button | The mirror opens for a few moments only | text=Click. Snap!
MR-ANTE | north | Quickly! | arrive=MREYE
