GROUP-HALLWAY | north | Into the mirror | arrive=IN-MIRROR
IN-MIRROR | raise short pole | The structure can only turn with its pole lifted | cmd
IN-MIRROR | push red panel | Turn the box clockwise until the arrow points north | text=indicates northwest.
IN-MIRROR | push red panel | Once more | text=indicates north.
IN-MIRROR | lower short pole | Lock the pole in the channel so the box can slide | cmd
IN-MIRROR | push mahogany panel | Slide north along the corridor | cmd
IN-MIRROR | push mahogany panel | Again | cmd
IN-MIRROR | push mahogany panel | Again: the Guardians' hall is next, and they must not see anything amiss | cmd
IN-MIRROR | raise short pole | Free the box to turn again | cmd
IN-MIRROR | push red panel | Clockwise | text=indicates northeast.
IN-MIRROR | push red panel | Clockwise | text=indicates east.
IN-MIRROR | push red panel | Clockwise | text=indicates southeast.
IN-MIRROR | push red panel | Until the arrow points south | text=indicates south.
IN-MIRROR | lower short pole | Lock it again | cmd
IN-MIRROR | push pine panel | A way out, facing the door | text=pine wall swings open
IN-MIRROR | out | Out into the hallway before the door | arrive=FRONT-DOOR
FRONT-DOOR | knock on door | You look the part: all seven of the old man's things | arrive=BEHIND-DOOR

## The last test
BEHIND-DOOR | master, follow me | Command the Dungeon Master | text=I will follow
BEHIND-DOOR | north | To the marble corridors | arrive=SOUTH-CORRIDOR
SOUTH-CORRIDOR | east | Around to the north | arrive=EAST-CORRIDOR
EAST-CORRIDOR | north | The corridor with the cell | arrive=NORTH-CORRIDOR
NORTH-CORRIDOR | master, north | Send him to the parapet, where the dial is | text=I am at the parapet
NORTH-CORRIDOR | master, turn dial to 4 | He can work the dial for you | cmd
NORTH-CORRIDOR | master, push button | And the button | cmd
NORTH-CORRIDOR | open door | The cell is not the one you saw before | text=cell door opens
NORTH-CORRIDOR | south | Into the cell | arrive=GROUP-PRISON-CELL
GROUP-PRISON-CELL | master, turn dial to 1 | Now make the cell take you away | cmd
GROUP-PRISON-CELL | master, push button | Carry the cell, and yourself, off | text=bare prison cell
GROUP-PRISON-CELL | unlock bronze door with key | The key fits any lock | text=bolt gives way
GROUP-PRISON-CELL | open bronze door | Open sesame | text=narrow passage
GROUP-PRISON-CELL | south | Your reward | arrive=NIRVANA
